    "seOwned: SurfEnglish-only primary words. They must not appear in a WordByWord page's title, H1, meta description, OG copy or features H2 (doc 03 §1.4 table; error). Generic language-learning words without 'English' belong to WordByWord (R39, R83) and must pass.",
    "seOwnedLead: the same intent anchored at the start — no H2 anywhere may open with a learn-English clause (R40).",
    "reserved.G1: how-to phrasing reserved for guide G1; never in the home title, H1, description or #cta H2 (doc 03 §1.6 M2, §3.8 HOWTO). A published locale without patterns gets a W.",
    "primaryTokens: words that identify a page's primary keyword (doc 03 §1.6). Latin/Cyrillic/Arabic tokens match whole words, CJK/Thai/Devanagari tokens match substrings. Within one locale, the set of pages whose title or H1 contains all tokens of page X must be exactly {X} (uniquePrimary).",
    "platform: the home description must name the platform (SEO-11)."
